(text "UART0 programming header uses 3.3V logic. Never connect 5V serial signals.\nHold BOOT while pulsing RESET for UART ROM download; the CM4 can drive these open-drain lines.\n2.2k pullup on HALTED_N: carrier NMOS pulls low only after the Linux kernel reaches final halt." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 56064f9b-774b-4e5d-aa6c-2ff843e00e25))
